  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot \u015Fimdi sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "\u015Eimdi i\xE7in \"T\u0131ls\u0131m D\xF6rtl\xFCs\xFC\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    \"ters\" se\xE7tin.\n\nKaybetme korkusunu anlatan kart ters \xE7\u0131k\u0131nca,
    sahip olunan \u015Feylerin sarfiyat\u0131nda a\u015F\u0131r\u0131ya ka\xE7\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    anl\u0131yoruz. \xC7evreye da\u011F\u0131tmakta oldu\u011Fun her \u015Feyde fazla
    a\xE7\u0131l\u0131yorsun {{isim}}. Hem sevgini \xF6l\xE7\xFCs\xFCz da\u011F\u0131t\u0131yorsun,
    hem dostlu\u011Funu, hem de t\xFCm maddi imkanlar\u0131n\u0131. {{burc}} burcu
    biri olarak zaten payla\u015Fmay\u0131 seven birisin. Buna bir de \"hay\u0131r\"
    diyememe y\xF6n\xFCn eklendi\u011Finde, kaynaklar\u0131n h\u0131zla ve kontrols\xFCzce
    azal\u0131yor. D\u0131\u015F ko\u015Fullar seni s\u0131n\u0131rland\u0131rmadan,
    sen kendi kendini s\u0131n\u0131rland\u0131rmal\u0131s\u0131n. Tasarruf yapmaya
    ba\u015Fla ki hayat\u0131nda bolluk ve bereketin h\u0131zla artt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6rebilesin."
